%% Logical companion to the native SVG; generated from the same service/edge definitions.
flowchart TB
  accTitle: AWS: controls beside the request path
  accDescr: ECR and ECS/Fargate launch role-separated tasks. VPC, PrivateLink and security groups constrain private connections. IAM, Secrets Manager, KMS and ACM provide scoped identities and protection. CloudWatch observes logs, delivery metrics and bounded supply.
  Images["Launch: ECR<br/>Versioned image digests<br/>Execution roles pull selected images"]
  Compute["Run: ECS + Fargate<br/>App, workers and both relays<br/>Independent raw ASGI gateway role"]
  Network["Connect: VPC<br/>Private task/data subnets + security groups<br/>Only specified roles, peers and ports"]
  Endpoints["PrivateLink + S3 endpoint<br/>ECR, secrets, logs and Bedrock privately<br/>S3 gateway endpoint carries scoped source I/O"]
  Roles["Authorize: IAM<br/>Separate task, execution and scanner roles<br/>Only workers receive model invocation access"]
  Secrets["Configure: Secrets Manager<br/>Role-specific startup secret injection<br/>App/stream proxy logins; direct bootstrap only"]
  Keys["Protect: KMS<br/>S3, RDS, MQ, Valkey, secrets and logs<br/>Selected role/service grants control access"]
  Trust["Endpoint: Route53 + ACM<br/>Route53 resolves ALB; ACM serves its certificate<br/>Proxy and database use verified CA trust"]
  SQL["Bound SQL: RDS Proxy<br/>App DML role; gateway four-table reader<br/>Nonlogin owner handles direct migrations"]
  Metrics["Observe: CloudWatch<br/>Retained stdout + EMF ConnectedStreams<br/>Queue age, proxy, fan-out and saturation alarms"]
